---
import PageLayout from '../layouts/PageLayout.astro';
---

<PageLayout
  title="Contact Us — Snake Game Online"
  description="Get in touch about Snake Game. Report a bug, suggest a feature, or ask a question. Free support by email or GitHub."
  eyebrow="CONTACT"
  heading="Get in touch."
  kicker="Found a bug, want a new mode, or just have a question? We'd love to hear from you. Snake Game is free to play and so is our support."
>
  <h2>Email</h2>
  <p>
    For bug reports, feature ideas, or anything else, write to
    <a href="mailto:yashkharb37@gmail.com">yashkharb37@gmail.com</a>. We read everything and
    usually reply within a few days.
  </p>

  <h2>GitHub</h2>
  <p>
    Snake Game is open source. You can report issues, suggest improvements, or look at the
    code at <a href="https://github.com/Yashkharb/Snake-Game" rel="noopener noreferrer">github.com/Yashkharb/Snake-Game</a>.
  </p>

  <h2>What to include</h2>
  <ul>
    <li>Which <strong>mode</strong> you were playing (Classic, Time Attack, Zen, or Daily).</li>
    <li>What <strong>browser and device</strong> you were using.</li>
    <li>A short description of <strong>what happened</strong> and what you expected instead.</li>
  </ul>

  <h2>Before you write</h2>
  <p>
    Check the <a href={`${import.meta.env.BASE_URL}about/`}>About page</a> for how the modes
    work, and the <a href={`${import.meta.env.BASE_URL}privacy/`}>Privacy Policy</a> for how
    your data is handled. Many questions — like "where are my scores saved?" — are answered
    there.
  </p>
</PageLayout>